 find useful equipment, and connect with other rebels to support your mission.<br></li><li> <strong>Dynamic Weather:</strong> Protect your people from the dangers of the weather by taking timely precautions and providing them with security.<br></li><li> <strong>Police's Secret Weapons:</strong> Unveil the dark secrets of the police force of Tortuga City as they deploy their advanced technology to overwhelm you.<br></li><li> <strong>Find Supporters:</strong> Expand your rebellion by recruiting allies and supporting them in your fight against the police.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935650/extras/8289a4429470672b9ce31cf540bc77ec.poster.avif?t=1744059103\" width=379 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2935650/extras/8289a4429470672b9ce31cf540bc77ec.webm?t=1744059103\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>...but be warned: the clock is ticking relentlessly as you only have 50 days to find an escape route before the police deploy their dreaded secret weapon and wipe you and your entire following out!",
